{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, take it. Move to new position, scan for objects. Check object properties. Perform specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewPosition    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
    "BT": {
        "Blackboard": [
